 r←UsageDataPeriod filename;year;month
⍝ Returns the period a usage data file covers, for a caption: "2025" for the file of a whole year,
⍝ "2026 up to August" for one that ends with a month; see `IsUsageDataFilename`.
 year←4↑(≢'usage-data-')↓filename
 :If '-'=⊃(≢'usage-data-YYYY')↓filename
     month←⊃⊃(//)⎕VFI 2↑(≢'usage-data-YYYY-')↓filename
     r←year,' up to ',month⊃Months
 :Else
     r←year
 :EndIf
⍝Done
